INSERT INTO "public"."users_profile" ("id", "email", "full_name", "english_name", "role", "department", "status", "created_at", "updated_at", "avatar_path", "phone", "bio") VALUES ('128228cb-fdbe-4c10-9da4-7c4c972af0dc', 'noelle.bagay@browave.com', 'Noelle P Bagay', null, 'mt', 'Manufacture Information', 'active', '2026-08-20 08:35:31.195162+00', '2026-08-21 03:11:11.237254+00', '128228cb-fdbe-4c10-9da4-7c4c972af0dc/avatar_1787270935992.png', '+63 961 639 3904', 'Computer Engineering graduate (UP Diliman)
WITH hands-on experience IN NLP research, web development, workflow automation, AND QA (web). Built production systems IN Python, n8n, AND Elasticsearch, including an NLP pipeline processing 700,000+ Filipino/Taglish documents at UP’s DSP Laboratory. Strengths: Technical Skills: Python, Elasticsearch/Kibana, transformer fine-tuning, embedded systems (PIC32); end-to-end pipeline design
WITH monitoring AND fault-tolerance; automated workflows that cut manual workload by 60%+; team leadership (Deputy VP for Treasury, Treasurer); adaptable across research, dev, AND QA. Soft Skills: goal-first direction-setting, self-directed accountability, structured root-cause problem-solving, cross-functional collaboration, adaptability under a fast pace environment What I Hope to Achieve: Through the MATTA program, I want to gain comprehensive exposure to Browave’s operations, products, AND functions, AND build practical skills IN problem-solving, decision-making, project management, communication, AND leadership, so I’m prepared to step into a permanent leadership or supervisory role AND contribute meaningfully to the company. Beyond technical AND managerial growth, I want to leave the program
